      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame the numbers as a strategic victory by highlighting that the 40% of viable villages reached represents over 1,500 immediate families secured clean water, while explicitly stating that the remaining zones require targeted infrastructure upgrades to be included in our next phase. By launching a simultaneous \"Road-Ready Initiative\" focused on supply chain resiliency next year, you can present this rate as a temporary threshold rather than a determinant of overall success. This approach acknowledges the challenge without letting it define the impact, allowing donors to feel confident that their $5M will directly fuel the transition from resilience to full-scale implementation.",
